png/8_IpE4yZO5lYZFayicukWlPz9aYHsWimHtXnLR7V5y0\"/><figcaption>王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250826/1036993170204135424513467.png/zu4q0dxySr7qmHi_8i06h2SPB4v_x-xXPE-CUTxPglE\"/><figcaption>王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250826/1036993171261100032561978.png/US7E_CMfcgQBt9oEkkws4C7KIPdYT7QwjcDtHo3A7R4\"/><figcaption>王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250826/1036993172544688128654398.png/wG2V7aNk8tPU_DmJfTT3q_x1JIzttmoZo_wNg6P8DYM\"/><figcaption>王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250826/1036993168652111872409675.png/L-_05r6pmLfgVxo3K_RFi2ZSusK2NpTi3EYthdxGLYU\"/><figcaption>王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250826/1036993173861699584309215.png/nGUT81uUb7Pw8LO0UDQLl0rma9zzHC-FiMHJdojByXY\"/><figcaption>王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250826/1036993170837475328539421.png/NrcGzLY9bFua9A9fNUT8AY1lP0hAZEHHBYG7oQWBu6E\"/><figcaption>王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250826/1036993169881174016417526.png/bNaXxH2lC3itcNMIu25S6nWG2TWnP-LK1RvR89Ub0fM\"/><figcaption>王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250826/1036993173211582464543826.png/zswYuHN8SeEMYqCxMwyd5EGst-o8G6ncXn7byl5-28o\"/><figcaption>王鶴棣（微博@王鶴棣）</figcaption></figure><p>「上海靜和醫療」也透露已將搜集完成網上造謠的證據，將會保留追究其法律責任的權利，請網友勿再傳播不實謠言。</p><p>延伸閲讀：</p><p>54歲裴勇俊罕見露面！韓流始祖「滿頭白髮」現身球場　男神優雅老去</p><p>李敏鎬《花樣男子》爆紅後突喊「休息1年」！親揭背後原因：突然出現另一個我</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T07:17:30.125817+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":822,"images":25,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}